    <data key="d0">Biopharma MRI Data Curation and Analytics Pipeline</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EiljRL0977M</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for processing, orchestrating, and monitoring MRI data using AWS Batch, FSx, EventBridge, Lambda, and Elasticsearch (OpenSearch).</data>
    <data key="d3">Data Lake &amp; Analytics</data>
